                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">36. SUBMISSIONS OF SAMPLES / DRAWINGS / LITERATURE:</th>
                    <th style="width: 70%;">It may be necessary to test samples or drawings or literature. All samples, drawings, or literature shall be furnished free of expense to New Mexico Tech. Returns shall only be made at the Bidder's request and expense.</th>
                </tr>
