    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <table style="width: 100%;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">38. TECHNICALITIES:</th>
                    <th style="width: 70%;">New Mexico Tech reserves the right to waive any technical irregularities in the form of the bid or the bid documents, including but not limited to, quantity or the services, construction or items of similar nature.</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <table style="width: 100%;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">39. TERM OF CONTRACT:</th>
                    <th style="width: 70%;">For all pricing agreements it shall be one (1) year from the date of award, unless otherwise specified. For one time purchase of goods and services the term shall be upon delivery and final payment.</th>
